1.  Organization and Project Background
We are VialletMart and we are a grocery/department store.
we are a medium sized store with 30 employees.
A new wireless network is required for better WIFI connection for the employees and the customers.
a common problem would be that there is old and slow WIFI that hasn't been upgraded in years, it is using wi-fi 4, 
it needs too be changed now more than ever because we are getting new cash registers and new self checkouts.

2. Project Objectives
for the amount of coverage will be the same but the WIFI will be way faster and have way higher bandwidth which will be required for our new devices
for the new WIFI that we will be using will be wi-fi 7 because it is the newest WIFI and can handle speeds up too 320 Gbps 
for security measures we will implement network segmentation which will divide our network into smaller sub networks, we will deploy next generation firewalls which will continuously filter inbound and outbound internet traffic and detect threats
we will deploy a monitoring and management tool called Zabbix which is a free enterprise  open source monitoring and management system which can automate device discovery and can detect external threats
for supporting growth WIFI 7 has plenty of bandwidth which will allow for further growth in the future

3. Scope of Work
the heatmap will be made by our vendor once we hire them
for the access point placements we will have 4 in the main area of the store and 3 in the back
before installing you need too clean the part of the ceiling the access point will be on before installing it, then you need too configure it and give it an Ip address in your network
the access point will bridge the wireless devices too the local area network
how we will configure the security on the access points is we will make a super unique and long password and enforce WPA3 encryption for wireless traffic 
we will test the access points by using tools like iperf3 between a wired server and a wireless device measuring maximum bandwidth and packet loss
We will document all the steps and procedures for all the configurations
basic maintenance will be doing updates on it regularly and cleaning the outside of the access point too prevent too much dust collecting on it

4. Technical Requirements
We will be implementing Wi-Fi 7 incase of future growth and with highspeed fiber connections 
for security we will be using WPA3-enterprise which will increase encryption strength too 192 bits which will also make server certificate validation mandatory which will prevent credential theft and ransom attacks from happening
Our guest network isolation will secure the public WIFI from the rest of the network and prevent anyone from accessing the rest of the network from the public WIFI while still allowing our customers too access the public WIFI
our VLAN integration will secure point of sale (POS) systems and protect our data and customers data especially customers with accounts with us, they could be at risk for data breach if not implemented, it works by segmenting the infrastructure in logical networks
for monitoring and reporting we implemented Zabbix which is a monitoring tool that will report any suspicious activity in our network
the Wi-Fi 7 will easily support the amount of customers and employees we have along with all our new access points and new cash registers and self checkouts
our new network will allow for more scalability for both scaling up and scaling out
for adding our new WIFI 7 we will need too upgrade a lot of devices too be able too be compatible with the new Wi-Fi too unlock its full potential

